### Test OTP System

# 1. Send OTP to email
POST http://localhost:4000/user/send-otp
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "test@example.com"
}

###

# 2. Verify OTP (for existing user)
POST http://localhost:4000/user/verify-otp
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "test@example.com",
    "otp": "123456"
}

###

# 3. Verify OTP (for new user)
POST http://localhost:4000/user/verify-otp
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "newuser@example.com",
    "otp": "123456",
    "name": "New User"
}

###
